    "the workflow-layer conflict that does fire under the shipped configuration is the lease: 76 HELD_BY_LIVE_WORKER verdicts across 360 acquisitions",
    "the bounded budget (max_inflight=4, max_queue=4) refused 2880 admissions before any mutation; every scheduled activity still reached exactly one terminal receipt ({'COMPLETED': 360})",
    "concurrent writers to one project head saw a first-attempt success ratio of 0.9359 (62 SNAPSHOT_STALE over 640 first attempts); after bounded retry the eventual success ratio was 1.0000 with 0 untyped failures",
    "storage held 480 canonical records in 196608 bytes, 409.6 bytes per record",
    "the index-lag envelope is missed at cold start, not in steady state: pooled p95 33.0 events against a first-rebuild-per-repeat set of [120, 120, 120] and a steady-state p95 of 25.0 events",
    "the same workflow load repeated 3x produced per-repeat workflow-latency p95s of [1397.2, 1393.6, 1403.5] ms against a 2000.0 ms budget; the reported verdict is on the pooled 360-sample distribution"
